# EB ships ONLY what the API needs — not the Expo app.
# Important: EB writes .ebignore-based zip of the repo; these rules pare it down.
*
!.gitignore
!Procfile
!.platform/
!.platform/**/*
# CRITICAL: ship the EB hooks that npm-install the server deps on the instance.
# Without this the deployed env has NO node_modules and the web process can't
# start ("Cannot find module 'dotenv/config'").
!.ebextensions/
!.ebextensions/**/*
!server/
!server/**/*
!server/node_modules/*
server/node_modules/.cache/